Text:
My top pick for Korean BBQ around here.  Last time boyfriend and I came here, we ordered the Kalbi and Bulgogi (you need to order at least two dishes to BBQ). Boyfriend also introduced me to the Seafood and Soft Tofu Soup (Soondubu Chigae) and it was amazing. I ordered it at Suishaya a month or so ago, and it just wasn't the same.
Note to self: Must convince boyfriend to come back here soon [;
The portions are generous, prices decent, and parking is more convenient than Koreana.
